from common import U,Q,S,T
UNITS=[
U('C101','Klaim yang kuat tanpa berlebihan','Mengatur kekuatan klaim melalui stance, hedging, dan batas bukti.',
'Hedging|Boosting|Scope of claim|Modal meaning|Concession|Evidence-aware language',
'Bahasa tingkat lanjut bukan sekadar kata yang panjang. Penulis yang terampil menentukan seberapa jauh bukti mengizinkan sebuah klaim. The survey proves that everyone prefers online classes terlalu luas bila hanya dua puluh peserta yang menjawab. Among respondents, online classes were more popular mempertahankan temuan tanpa menggeneralisasikannya.||May, appears to, is likely to, dan suggests mempunyai fungsi berbeda dari proves atau establishes. Tambahkan batas populasi, waktu, dan metode. Namun jangan menumpuk pelemah sampai makna menghilang: It might perhaps possibly be somewhat useful tidak lebih teliti daripada It may be useful for beginners. Klaim yang terbatas tetapi jelas lebih dapat dipertanggungjawabkan.',
[('evidence suggests that + clause','The interviews suggest that timing matters.','Dukungan, bukan bukti mutlak.'),('within / among + scope','Among the respondents, evening classes were preferred.','Batasi populasi.'),('although + concession, claim','Although the sample is small, the pattern merits further study.','Akui batas tanpa menghapus temuan.')],
('The survey proves that all students learn better online.','The survey suggests that some respondents found online learning helpful.','Survey pendapat terbatas tidak membuktikan efektivitas bagi semua orang.'),
'A fictional pilot involved thirty volunteers from one school. Twenty-four reported that short review sessions helped them feel more prepared. Their test scores were not compared with those of a control group. The organiser described the feedback as promising, while acknowledging that confidence and achievement are different outcomes.',
'acknowledge=mengakui|respondent=responden|scope=cakupan|tentative=sementara/tentatif|achievement=capaian|merit=layak mendapat',
[Q('Kesimpulan yang didukung pilot …','Most volunteers reported greater preparedness.','All students achieved higher test scores.||Short reviews are proven effective everywhere.','24 dari 30 melaporkan kesiapan; skor komparatif tidak tersedia.','reading'),Q('Mengapa achievement tidak dapat disimpulkan?','No comparative test-score evidence is provided.','Thirty is never a valid number.||Volunteers cannot express opinions.','Batas terletak pada jenis bukti, bukan larangan angka tertentu.','reasoning'),Q('Pilih klaim dengan scope eksplisit.','Among participants, the response was positive.','People everywhere approved.||There is no possible disagreement.','Among participants membatasi cakupan.','register'),Q('The results ___ a possible association.','suggest','prove universally||guarantee','Association tentatif cocok dengan suggest.'),Q('Kalimat paling jelas tanpa hedging berlebihan …','The approach may help beginners.','It might perhaps possibly somehow be helpful.||It definitely benefits everyone.','Satu modal cukup bila batasnya jelas.','editing'),S('Lengkapi: Although the sample is small, the pattern ___ further study. (merit)','merits','Subjek tunggal pattern membutuhkan merits.')],
[T('speaking','Sampaikan hasil pilot dalam satu menit: temuan, keterbatasan, dan penelitian berikutnya.','Twenty-four of thirty volunteers felt more prepared. That is encouraging, but it does not demonstrate improved achievement. A follow-up should compare performance as well as confidence.','Angka tepat|Confidence dibedakan dari achievement|Usulan menjawab keterbatasan'),T('writing','Tulis paragraf evaluasi 90–120 kata tentang pilot. Jangan menambahkan data.','The pilot provides encouraging evidence about participants\' perceived preparedness. Twenty-four of the thirty volunteers reported feeling better prepared after short review sessions. However, the participants came from one school and chose to join, so their responses may not represent a wider student population. Moreover, the study did not compare test scores with those of a control group. The findings therefore concern confidence rather than demonstrated improvement in achievement. A follow-up could use comparable groups, record performance before and after the intervention, and retain the same feedback questions. This would help distinguish a positive experience from a measurable learning benefit.','90–120 kata|Cakupan dan batas akurat|Tindak lanjut relevan')],'certainty',('B208',)),
U('C102','Penekanan: inversion dan cleft','Menonjolkan informasi tanpa mengubah makna atau membuat semua kalimat formal.',
'Negative-fronting inversion|Only after|Not until|It-cleft|What-cleft|Register choice',
'Urutan biasa adalah subject lalu verb. Setelah pembuka pembatas tertentu, klausa utama memakai auxiliary sebelum subject: Only after the test did we notice the fault. Frasa pembuka tidak otomatis membalik semua klausa; pada Only after we tested it did we notice…, we tested tetap urutan biasa.||Cleft memecah kalimat untuk menyorot informasi: It was the deadline that caused concern menekankan deadline; What we need is more time menekankan kebutuhan. Inversion cocok untuk penekanan formal tertentu, bukan dekorasi wajib. Dalam percakapan sehari-hari, We only noticed the fault after the test sering lebih alami.',
[('Only after … + auxiliary + subject + V','Only after the trial did we revise the plan.','Penekanan pada urutan.'),('It is/was + focus + that/who …','It was Maya who spotted the error.','Menyorot pelaku.'),('What + clause + be + focus','What we need is a clear deadline.','Menyorot kebutuhan.')],
('Only after the trial we understood the problem.','Only after the trial did we understand the problem.','Pembuka pembatas ini memicu inversion klausa utama; setelah did gunakan V1.'),
'At first, the team blamed the software. Only after a second test did they discover a damaged cable. It was the cable, not the program, that caused the interruption. What the team needed was a clearer checklist, so they revised the inspection procedure.',
'interruption=gangguan|inspection=pemeriksaan|focus=fokus|revise=merevisi|spot=menemukan|restriction=pembatasan',
[Q('Only after the call ___ the mistake.','did she notice','she did noticed||she noticed did','Auxiliary did mendahului subject.'),Q('Not until Monday did we receive it: kapan barang diterima?','On Monday, not earlier.','Before Monday.||Never.','Not until menandai batas awal kejadian.','meaning'),Q('It was the cable that caused the problem menyorot …','penyebab','jam kerja||jumlah teknisi','Cleft memfokuskan the cable.','meaning'),Q('Versi santai yang paling alami …','We only noticed it after the test.','Only after did the test we notice it.||What we did was that the test only.','Makna dapat dipertahankan tanpa inversion.','register'),Q('Apa tindakan tim setelah menemukan penyebab?','They revised the inspection procedure.','They replaced every computer.||They cancelled all future tests.','Tindakan disebut eksplisit.','reading'),S('Lengkapi: Only then did we ___ the risk. (understand)','understand','Did diikuti base form.')],
[T('speaking','Jelaskan satu temuan dengan kalimat biasa, lalu satu cleft. Jelaskan apa yang ditekankan.','We discovered a damaged cable. It was the cable that caused the interruption. I am emphasising the cause because we initially blamed the software.','Makna stabil|Penekanan beralasan|Penyampaian natural'),T('writing','Tulis laporan singkat lima kalimat. Gunakan satu inversion dan satu cleft saja.','The initial test suggested a software fault. Only after a second inspection did we identify a damaged cable. It was the cable that interrupted the connection. We replaced it and repeated the test successfully. The checklist now includes a separate cable inspection.','Inversion benar|Cleft membantu fokus|Tidak memenuhi semua kalimat dengan penekanan')],'emphasis',('C101',)),
U('C103','Padat tetapi tetap jelas','Menggunakan nominalisation, noun phrases, dan pilihan aktif/pasif secara bertanggung jawab.',
'Nominalisation|Complex noun phrases|Agency|Active/passive choice|Concision|Reader effort',
'Nominalisation mengubah kegiatan menjadi nomina: decide → decision, assess → assessment. Ini berguna untuk merujuk gagasan sebelumnya: The assessment identified two risks. Namun tumpukan nomina seperti implementation process optimisation strategy bisa menyembunyikan hubungan antarkata. Pecah menjadi klausa bila pembaca harus menebak.||Bandingkan A decision was made regarding postponement dengan The committee decided to postpone the event. Kalimat kedua menunjukkan pelaku dan tindakan. Passive tetap tepat bila proses atau objek menjadi fokus, misalnya Samples were stored at 4°C. Pilih berdasarkan kebutuhan pembaca, bukan anggapan bahwa pasif selalu lebih ilmiah.',
[('verb → noun','assess → assessment; decide → decision','Meringkas konsep untuk dirujuk.'),('actor + verb + object','The committee approved the budget.','Memperjelas tanggung jawab.'),('noun + of / for / that-clause','a proposal for improving access','Membuka hubungan yang terlalu padat.')],
('An implementation of a cancellation was undertaken.','The organiser cancelled the event.','Verba langsung lebih jelas ketika pelaku dan tindakan penting.'),
'The review of the booking process revealed repeated delays. The operations team approved a simpler form, and the designer will produce a prototype by Friday. Customer details will remain encrypted. The report names the team responsible for each change but uses passive voice where the handling of data is the focus.',
'nominalisation=pembentukan nomina|agency=kejelasan pelaku tindakan|prototype=purwarupa|encrypted=terenkripsi|approve=menyetujui|concise=ringkas dan jelas',
[Q('Versi paling jelas untuk menetapkan tanggung jawab …','The finance team approved the budget.','Approval was somehow undertaken.||There was an occurrence of approval.','Pelaku dan tindakan eksplisit.','editing'),Q('Bentuk nomina dari assess …','assessment','assessive||assessingness','Assessment adalah nomina yang lazim.','vocabulary'),Q('Mengapa passive dipakai pada Customer details will remain encrypted?','Fokusnya perlindungan data.','Semua kalimat profesional wajib pasif.||Pelaku pasti tidak ada.','Pilihan fokus tidak sama dengan aturan wajib.','reading'),Q('Apa yang harus tersedia Jumat?','a prototype','a final nationwide launch||a new finance team','Bacaan menyebut prototype.','reading'),Q('Pilihan yang membongkar noun stack dengan jelas …','a plan to improve access to training','training access improvement plan strategy process||an access of improvement training','Hubungan tujuan dan objek dibuat jelas.','editing'),S('Ubah nomina ke verba: The committee made a decision. → The committee ___.','decided','Decided mempertahankan makna dengan kata lebih sedikit.','editing')],
[T('speaking','Jelaskan proses rekaan dengan menyebut siapa mengerjakan apa dan kapan.','The designer will prepare the prototype by Friday. The operations team will test it on Monday. Customer data will remain encrypted throughout the trial.','Penanggung jawab jelas|Urutan jelas|Passive digunakan dengan tujuan'),T('writing','Sunting kalimat ini lalu jelaskan alasannya: The implementation of a revision to the procedure will be undertaken by the team.','The team will revise the procedure. This version retains the actor and action while removing unnecessary nominalisations. If the revision itself is the topic of the paragraph, The revision will begin on Monday may still be appropriate.','Makna inti dipertahankan|Lebih mudah dipahami|Alasan mempertimbangkan konteks')],'clarity',('C102',)),
U('C104','Paragraf yang mengalir','Menghubungkan informasi lama dan baru melalui reference, substitution, dan urutan gagasan.',
'Given-new progression|Reference|Ellipsis|Substitution|Lexical chains|Connector precision',
'Koherensi tumbuh dari hubungan gagasan, bukan dari menambahkan moreover pada setiap kalimat. Mulailah dari sesuatu yang sudah dikenal pembaca, lalu berikan informasi baru. Informasi baru itu dapat menjadi titik awal kalimat berikutnya. The library extended its hours. This change allowed evening access.||This, it, they, one, dan do so menghindari pengulangan, tetapi rujukannya harus jelas. This improvement lebih jelas daripada this bila kalimat sebelumnya memuat beberapa kejadian. However menandai kontras, therefore akibat atau inferensi, dan moreover penambahan. Penghubung yang salah dapat mengubah logika meskipun kalimatnya gramatikal.',
[('known topic → new information','The club introduced a forum. The forum attracted volunteers.','Bangun rantai informasi.'),('this + summary noun','This reduction eased the workload.','Rujukan eksplisit.'),('do so / one / ones','Some members joined; others chose not to do so.','Substitution dengan rujukan jelas.')],
('The service improved. However, customers became more satisfied. (maksud: akibat)','The service improved. As a result, customers became more satisfied.','However mengisyaratkan kontras; maksud hubungan di sini akibat.'),
'The library extended its opening hours in May. This change allowed working parents to visit after dinner. Evening visits increased, but staffing costs also rose. The additional expense led the manager to propose a volunteer trial. Two nearby libraries had already adopted a similar approach, and the manager hoped to do so without reducing service quality.',
'cohesion=keterpautan bahasa|reference=rujukan|expense=biaya|adopt=menerapkan|as a result=akibatnya|nevertheless=meskipun demikian',
[Q('This change merujuk pada …','extended opening hours','a reduction in service quality||a new building','Rujukan ditemukan pada kalimat sebelumnya.','reading'),Q('do so pada akhir bacaan berarti …','adopt a similar volunteer approach','close the library||increase every fee','Substitution mengambil kegiatan yang disebut.','reading'),Q('Hubungan visits increased, but costs also rose …','manfaat disertai konsekuensi biaya','dua kalimat yang tidak berhubungan||bukti biaya selalu turun','But memperkenalkan sisi kontras.','meaning'),Q('Rujukan paling jelas setelah dua masalah berbeda disebut …','This delay affected delivery.','This affected that.||It made it so.','Summary noun delay mengurangi ambiguitas.','editing'),Q('Penghubung untuk tambahan alasan yang searah …','Moreover','Nevertheless||Despite this','Moreover menambahkan dukungan.'),S('Ganti pengulangan: Some joined the trial; others chose not to join the trial. → others chose not to ___ .','do so','Do so menggantikan kegiatan join the trial.','editing')],
[T('speaking','Jelaskan masalah, konsekuensi, dan solusi dalam empat kalimat. Pastikan setiap this punya rujukan jelas.','Evening visits increased. This increase raised staffing costs. The extra cost prompted a volunteer trial. The trial will be reviewed after a month.','Rantai gagasan jelas|Rujukan tunggal|Hubungan logis'),T('writing','Tulis dua paragraf pendek: manfaat jam panjang lalu risiko dan evaluasinya.','Longer opening hours made the library accessible to working parents. This improvement was accompanied by an increase in evening visits.\n\nHowever, staffing costs also rose. To address the additional expense, the manager proposed a volunteer trial. The trial should be evaluated against both cost and service-quality measures before it becomes permanent.','Transisi antarparagraf|Rujukan spesifik|Tidak mengarang hasil evaluasi')],'cohesion',('C103',)),
U('C105','Merangkum dua sumber dengan jujur','Menyintesis sumber, mempertahankan batas klaim, dan membedakan kutipan dari parafrasa.',
'Paraphrase|Attribution|Synthesis|Agreement and tension|Source scope|Reporting verbs',
'Parafrasa mengubah susunan dan ungkapan sambil mempertahankan makna, bukan sekadar mengganti tiap kata dengan sinonim. Jika sumber mengatakan may reduce waiting times, parafrasa eliminates delays memperkuat klaim secara keliru. Sumber tetap perlu disebut meskipun kalimat sudah ditulis ulang.||Sintesis mengorganisasi gagasan lintas sumber menurut pertanyaan, bukan menempelkan dua ringkasan. Cari kesamaan, perbedaan populasi atau ukuran hasil, dan hal yang belum terjawab. According to memberi atribusi; argues, reports, dan finds memberi informasi berbeda tentang jenis klaim. Dalam latihan ini sumber rekaan, sehingga tidak boleh diperlakukan sebagai penelitian nyata.',
[('A reports …, whereas B examines …','A reports shorter queues, whereas B examines staff workload.','Bandingkan ukuran hasil.'),('both …, but neither …','Both discuss access, but neither measures long-term learning.','Irisan dan batas.'),('according to + source','According to the pilot report, waiting times fell.','Atribusi yang jelas.')],
('The reports prove the new system is better in every respect.','The reports suggest shorter waits but identify a possible increase in staff workload.','Sintesis harus memuat temuan yang mendukung dan yang membatasi.'),
'Fictional Source A: A clinic pilot recorded a fall in average waiting time from thirty to twenty minutes after online booking began. The report covered four weeks. Fictional Source B: Interviews with six reception staff described a heavier workload because online and telephone requests had to be reconciled. No patient safety outcomes were measured in either source.',
'synthesis=sintesis|attribute=mengatribusikan|reconcile=mencocokkan|whereas=sedangkan|outcome=hasil yang diukur|paraphrase=parafrasa',
[Q('Persamaan kedua sumber …','They concern the effects of a booking change.','They measure patient safety.||They cover ten years.','Keduanya membahas perubahan booking dengan ukuran berbeda.','reading'),Q('Klaim yang tidak didukung …','The system improved patient safety.','Waiting time fell in the pilot.||Some staff described heavier work.','Safety tidak diukur.','reasoning'),Q('Parafrasa akurat atas may reduce delays …','could shorten waiting times','eliminates every delay||has no effect on waiting','Modal kemungkinan dipertahankan.','editing'),Q('Sintesis yang tepat …','Shorter waits may coexist with heavier administrative work.','The staff interviews invalidate every waiting-time record.||Both reports show universal benefits.','Ukuran berbeda dapat sama-sama benar.','reasoning'),Q('Mengapa perlu menulis fictional sources dalam laporan latihan?','Agar sumber rekaan tidak disajikan sebagai riset nyata.','Agar semua klaim dianggap salah.||Agar atribusi tidak diperlukan.','Status sumber adalah bagian dari akurasi.','ethics'),S('Lengkapi: ___ to Source A, waiting time fell.','According','According to memperkenalkan atribusi.')],
[T('speaking','Ringkas dua sumber dalam 60–90 detik untuk manajer yang belum membacanya.','The fictional pilot recorded shorter average waits over four weeks. Staff interviews, however, suggest additional administrative work. These outcomes can coexist, and neither source tells us whether patient safety changed.','Kedua sumber terwakili|Tidak menambah sebab pasti|Batas diutarakan'),T('writing','Tulis sintesis 90–120 kata dengan atribusi, satu ketegangan, dan satu pertanyaan lanjutan.','The two fictional sources describe different consequences of online booking. Source A records a reduction in average waiting time from thirty to twenty minutes during a four-week pilot. Source B, based on interviews with six reception staff, identifies additional work in reconciling online and telephone requests. These findings are not necessarily contradictory: a faster service for patients may require more administrative effort. Neither report assesses patient safety, and the short observation period limits conclusions about sustainability. A useful follow-up would examine whether the reduced waiting time can be maintained without excessive staff workload, while also recording relevant safety outcomes.','90–120 kata|Atribusi benar|Sintesis bukan dua ringkasan terpisah')],'evidence',('C104',)),
U('C106','Negosiasi dan kesantunan yang efektif','Menyampaikan batas, permintaan, dan kompromi secara jelas sesuai relasi.',
'Indirect requests|Conditional offers|Polite disagreement|Face and context|Clarifying constraints|Negotiated summary',
'Could you possibly… dapat melunakkan permintaan, tetapi kalimat yang terlalu berputar bisa menyembunyikan tindakan yang dibutuhkan. Kesantunan ditentukan hubungan, urgensi, dan norma setempat; tidak ada satu tingkat tidak langsung yang cocok untuk semua budaya. Pisahkan pengakuan kebutuhan lawan bicara dari persetujuan: I understand the deadline does not mean I accept it.||Conditional offers menghubungkan konsesi dengan syarat: We could deliver on Friday if the scope were reduced. Akhiri negosiasi dengan ringkasan siapa melakukan apa, kapan, serta bagian yang belum disepakati. Hindari menyatakan tentative agreement sebagai keputusan final.',
[('I understand …; however, …','I understand the urgency; however, we need a day to test.','Akui kebutuhan lalu beri batas.'),('We could … provided that …','We could deliver Friday provided that the scope is reduced.','Tawaran bersyarat.'),('To confirm, … remains open','To confirm, the deadline is agreed; the budget remains open.','Pisahkan sepakat dan belum.')],
('As discussed, everything is agreed. (padahal harga belum disepakati)','We agreed on Friday delivery; the price is still under discussion.','Ringkasan harus memelihara status setiap keputusan.'),
'Client: Could the full report be ready by Friday? Analyst: We can provide the summary on Friday, but the complete analysis needs two more working days. Client: A summary would help, provided it includes the main risks. Analyst: That is feasible. We still need to confirm the revised fee. Client: Agreed; please send a separate quotation.',
'provided that=asalkan|scope=lingkup|feasible=layak dilakukan|quotation=penawaran harga|constraint=batasan|concession=konsesi',
[Q('Yang disepakati untuk Jumat …','a summary including the main risks','the full analysis and final fee||no deliverable','Kesepakatan terbatas pada summary.','reading'),Q('Apa yang masih terbuka?','the revised fee','whether risks belong in the summary||whether Friday exists','Fee perlu quotation terpisah.','reading'),Q('I understand the urgency berarti …','mengakui kebutuhan mendesak','pasti menyetujui semua syarat||menolak mendengar','Pengakuan bukan persetujuan.','pragmatics'),Q('Tawaran bersyarat yang jelas …','We can reduce the fee if the scope is smaller.','We can maybe somehow do something.||Everything will definitely be free.','Syarat dan konsesi terlihat.','register'),Q('Penolakan profesional yang tetap jelas …','We cannot meet Monday, but Wednesday is feasible.','We will try when we already know it is impossible.||Your request is ridiculous.','Batas disertai alternatif realistis.','pragmatics'),S('Lengkapi: We can deliver Friday, provided ___ the scope is reduced.','that','Provided that memperkenalkan syarat.')],
[T('speaking','Role-play klien dan analis. Negosiasikan tenggat dengan satu syarat dan tutup dengan ringkasan.','We can send the summary on Friday, provided it includes only the agreed sections. The full analysis would follow on Tuesday. To confirm, the fee still needs approval.','Respons menanggapi lawan bicara|Syarat eksplisit|Ringkasan akurat'),T('writing','Tulis email tindak lanjut rapat berdasarkan dialog, tanpa mengarang harga.','Thank you for the discussion. We agreed to provide a summary, including the main risks, on Friday. The complete analysis will require two additional working days. The revised fee has not yet been confirmed; I will send a separate quotation for your review. Please let me know if this summary differs from your understanding.','Kesepakatan dan isu terbuka|Tindakan selanjutnya|Nada kooperatif')],'pragmatics',('C105',)),
U('C107','Membaca di balik klaim','Membedakan fakta, asumsi, framing, dan kesimpulan dalam teks persuasif.',
'Assumption|Selection bias|Loaded language|Causality|Counterargument|Proportional conclusion',
'Sebuah teks dapat akurat secara kalimat tetapi menyesatkan melalui pemilihan informasi. Ninety per cent of respondents approved tidak sama dengan Ninety per cent of all members approved. Pertanyaan pentingnya: siapa yang menjawab, siapa yang tidak, apa yang ditanyakan, dan apa pembandingnya?||Bahasa seperti obviously, merely, dan revolutionary dapat mengarahkan sikap pembaca tanpa menambah bukti. Menilai framing bukan berarti menolak otomatis. Rekonstruksi argumennya secara adil, tentukan asumsi yang diperlukan, lalu ajukan bukti yang akan menguatkan atau melemahkan kesimpulan. Counterargument terbaik membahas alasan, bukan menyerang penulis.',
[('claim + because + reason','The author recommends expansion because uptake increased.','Temukan tulang punggung argumen.'),('This assumes that …','This assumes that respondents represent all users.','Buat asumsi tersembunyi eksplisit.'),('An alternative explanation is …','An alternative explanation is a seasonal increase.','Uji sebab alternatif.')],
('Ninety per cent of respondents approved, so every member supports it.','Ninety per cent of respondents approved; support among non-respondents is unknown.','Populasi responden tidak boleh diam-diam diperluas.'),
'A fictional advertisement states: Our revolutionary study room is an obvious success. Ninety per cent of survey respondents recommend it, so the council should immediately open ten more rooms. The survey link was sent only to people who had renewed their membership. The advertisement does not state how many people responded or how much expansion would cost.',
'assumption=asumsi|framing=pembingkaian|respondent=responden|renew=memperpanjang|representative=mewakili populasi|counterargument=argumen tandingan',
[Q('Masalah seleksi sampel …','Only renewing members received the survey.','All residents were surveyed.||No survey was mentioned.','Pengguna yang tidak memperpanjang tidak terwakili.','reading'),Q('Kata yang memberi penilaian tanpa bukti tambahan …','revolutionary','respondents||membership','Revolutionary membingkai secara evaluatif.','language'),Q('Kesimpulan paling adil …','Positive feedback is reported, but the expansion case is incomplete.','Every respondent must be lying.||Ten rooms are definitely necessary.','Kritik tidak perlu meniadakan semua data.','reasoning'),Q('Bukti tambahan yang relevan …','demand, costs, and feedback from non-renewing members','the colour of the advertisement alone||the author\'s favourite food','Bukti menjawab representasi dan kelayakan.','reasoning'),Q('Asumsi ekspansi sepuluh ruang …','Demand and resources would support that scale.','All rooms must be identical in colour.||No user needs a seat.','Lompatan dari kepuasan ke skala perlu dukungan.','reasoning'),S('Lengkapi: This argument ___ that respondents represent all members. (assume)','assumes','Argument tunggal memakai assumes.')],
[T('speaking','Tanggapi iklan secara adil selama dua menit. Awali dengan klaim terbaiknya lalu jelaskan dua batas.','The reported feedback is positive, which gives the council a reason to investigate. However, the sample excludes people who did not renew, and the costs are missing. I would request broader feedback and a feasibility estimate before supporting ten new rooms.','Argumen direkonstruksi adil|Dua batas spesifik|Rekomendasi proporsional'),T('writing','Tulis tanggapan untuk dewan dengan satu bukti yang diterima, dua pertanyaan, dan keputusan sementara.','The reported approval rate is encouraging, but it reflects only respondents who had renewed their membership. How many people answered, and how does demand compare with the cost of ten additional rooms? I recommend commissioning a broader needs assessment before approving expansion. This would preserve the potential benefit while testing the assumptions behind the proposed scale.','Tidak menyerang pribadi|Pertanyaan relevan|Keputusan tidak melampaui bukti')],'evidence',('C106',)),
U('C108','Proposal profesional yang dapat ditindaklanjuti','Mengintegrasikan analisis, rekomendasi, risiko, dan evaluasi dalam proposal.',
'Executive summary|Problem definition|Options appraisal|Risk and mitigation|Success measures|Presentation Q&A',
'Proposal yang baik memudahkan pembaca mengambil keputusan. Nyatakan masalah, pilihan yang layak, alasan pilihan, kebutuhan pelaksanaan, risiko, dan cara mengevaluasi. Pisahkan angka yang sudah diketahui dari target yang diusulkan. Target bukan prediksi yang sudah terbukti.||Executive summary ditulis untuk pembaca yang mungkin hanya membaca bagian itu. Gunakan rekomendasi konkret beserta syaratnya. Dalam tanya jawab, jawab inti pertanyaan terlebih dahulu, akui informasi yang belum tersedia, lalu sebut cara mendapatkannya. I do not yet have that figure adalah respons profesional bila diikuti langkah yang masuk akal.',
[('We recommend … subject to …','We recommend a pilot subject to budget approval.','Rekomendasi bersyarat.'),('The principal risk is …; to mitigate it, …','The principal risk is low uptake; to mitigate it, we will survey users.','Hubungkan risiko dan respons.'),('Success will be assessed against …','Success will be assessed against attendance and cost targets.','Tetapkan ukuran sebelum pelaksanaan.')],
('The pilot will certainly double attendance.','The pilot aims to improve attendance; its effect will be evaluated.','Sasaran masa depan belum merupakan fakta hasil.'),
'Fictional brief: A community centre has an unused room on Wednesday evenings. Fifteen members have expressed interest in a conversation club, but no registrations have been collected. The coordinator can supervise a four-week pilot within the existing staffing budget. Equipment costs and accessibility needs still require confirmation.',
'proposal=usulan terstruktur|mitigate=mengurangi risiko|uptake=partisipasi|criterion=kriteria|subject to=bergantung persetujuan/syarat|accessibility=aksesibilitas',
[Q('Apa yang sudah diketahui?','Fifteen members expressed interest.','Fifteen members have paid.||Equipment will cost nothing.','Minat belum menjadi pendaftaran.','reading'),Q('Apa yang masih harus dikonfirmasi?','equipment costs and accessibility needs','whether Wednesday exists||the exact success of the pilot','Dua isu disebut belum pasti.','reading'),Q('Ukuran evaluasi yang relevan …','attendance, participant feedback, and actual costs','only the colour of the poster||a guaranteed doubling of income','Ukuran sesuai tujuan dan sumber daya.','reasoning'),Q('Respons tepat ketika biaya belum diketahui …','We still need quotations before confirming the total.','The cost is certainly zero.||That question does not matter.','Ketidakpastian dinyatakan dengan tindak lanjut.','pragmatics'),Q('Rekomendasi sesuai brief …','Run a four-week pilot after confirming costs and access.','Launch permanent sessions nationwide tomorrow.||Cancel without examining feasibility.','Skala dan syarat sesuai informasi.','reasoning'),S('Lengkapi: We recommend a pilot subject ___ budget approval.','to','Subject to memperkenalkan syarat.')],
[T('speaking','Presentasikan proposal tiga menit, lalu jawab: Bagaimana jika hanya tiga orang datang?','I recommend a four-week pilot after we confirm equipment and accessibility costs. If attendance is low, we should ask registered members about barriers before deciding whether to continue. We should not interpret initial interest as guaranteed attendance.','Rekomendasi jelas|Menanggapi pertanyaan spontan|Tidak membuat jaminan palsu'),T('writing','Tulis executive summary 130–170 kata berdasarkan brief. Labeli target sebagai usulan.','I recommend a four-week conversation-club pilot on Wednesday evenings, subject to confirmation of equipment costs and accessibility requirements. The centre already has an available room, and the coordinator can supervise the pilot within the existing staffing budget. Fifteen members have expressed interest, but this should not be treated as confirmed attendance. Before launch, we should collect registrations and ask participants about access needs. As proposed evaluation criteria, we could track weekly attendance, participant feedback, and expenditure against the approved budget. The main risk is that initial interest will not translate into regular participation. A reminder system and a short follow-up with absentees may help identify barriers. At the end of four weeks, the coordinator should present the findings and recommend whether to continue, adapt, or stop the club. A permanent commitment should follow that review rather than precede it.','130–170 kata|Fakta/target terpisah|Risiko dan keputusan evaluasi')],'proposal',('C107',))
]
